{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11448","headline":"将赴成都草堂途中有作先寄严郑公五首 三 · 杜甫","name":"将赴成都草堂途中有作先寄严郑公五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹寒沙碧浣花溪，菱刺藤梢咫尺迷。\n过客径须愁出入，居人不自解东西。\n书签药里封蛛网，野店山桥送马蹄。\n岂藉荒庭春草色，先判一饮醉如泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11448.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11448","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}